> ref. 5); and (3) we provide a method for representing under-modelled
> and missing risks. A key difference in the emulation process is that
> ref. 5 uses global warming levels, while we use local temperatures,
> which allows better handling of spatial and temporal variability in the
> projections. The Monetary Valuation of Risks and Opportunities in
